{"parse": {"title": "矢车菊说起的那一年-04", "pageid": 141917, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9F%A2%E8%BD%A6%E8%8F%8A%E8%AF%B4%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4-03\" title=\"矢车菊说起的那一年-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">矢车菊说起的那一年-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9F%A2%E8%BD%A6%E8%8F%8A%E8%AF%B4%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4-05\" title=\"矢车菊说起的那一年-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">矢车菊说起的那一年</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.94.B6.E8.8E.B7.E6.9C.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"收获月\">收获月</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 收获月</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">28.08.1991 夜</span></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">柏林以东家中（夜晚）</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p><small style=\"color: #999;\">翻开日记本</small><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 13 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"760\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 13 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"754\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n<i style=\"display:block; color:#b2b2b2; border:1px dotted #bbb; border-radius:10px; padding:10px; width:fit-content\">\n<b>1991/08/28  晴朗</b><br />\n上午交班时，洛尔告诉我今天是歌德诞辰242周年。好吧，我承认我之前只是——听说过他。<br />\n洛尔和我科普，说布莱希特不太待见歌德。但她给我介绍了几首歌德的诗，都挺有趣的。<br />\n最近世界又发生了太多变化……我可能不会再对任何事情感到吃惊了。</i>\n柏林以东放下笔，沉思了片刻。<br />\n<i style=\"display:block; color:#b2b2b2; border:1px dotted #bbb; border-radius:10px; padding:10px; width:fit-content\">\n不过，我的确是侥幸活得不错的那一批。<br />\n就像布莱希特的诗：<b><br />“不过是侥幸：<br />朋友们早早逝去，我却活着。昨夜梦中<br />我听他们议论我，说：‘适者生存。’</b>”<br />\n离职后，应当是<b>老师</b>保护了我的档案，让我反而有机会尝试其他工作。<br />\n去年也是恰好听到别人的闲聊，我才没在黑市兑换太多那边的马克，而是等到官方规定的2∶1汇率，去银行兑换的。<br />\n要知道，当时私下兑换的话，可能20个东边的马克才能兑换1个西边的马克！<br />\n显然，我得以幸存，并不是因为我有多么特别——<br />\n只是有些小聪明、小能力，以及足够的幸运。<br />\n记得当时附近的银行里，有人没赶上兑换时间，差点和柜员打了一架。<br />\n类似连线的克林特他父母的情况，现在也不少。前几天，我还听到住楼下的阿姨怀念道：“还是以前更好。”<br />\n楼上的生物学教授也这样说——他的学院空降了一位西边的教授，挤走了他升职的机会。<br />\n但对街的化学专业博士生却说现在更好——他加入了西边一位教授的实验室，下个月将代表老师出国开会。<br />\n洛尔也曾和我说，此前她总因为先天残疾找不到工作，但现在多了很多兼职的岗位，自然也多了很多机会。<br />\n之前总去买施普雷瓦尔德酸黄瓜的那家杂货店，现在也大变样，进口食品琳琅满目，把以前的老牌子都挤走了。<br />\n但老板娘却说，现在的我应当高兴，因为随时都能买到杏仁糖了。<br />\n变化之风才是永恒的。只是我们身处其中，很难分清楚这场风到底是寒冷还是温和。<br />\n我们要么接受，要么忍耐。</i><br />\n女孩叹了一口气，合上日记本。<br />\n夏夜喧闹，窗外的蝉鸣仿佛是星星在叽叽咕咕地聊天。<br />\n而窗边的矢车菊正是花期，好多朵簇拥在一起。<br />\n少女照例在睡前给它们浇水。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_04_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 04 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a7/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_04_1.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_04_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a7/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_04_1.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_04_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a7/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_04_1.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_04_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"760\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“……！”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“还有一朵异色的矢车菊！”</i><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>少女的声音充满惊喜，但随之又低落下来。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“只可惜……过不了多久，秋天就要到了。再美丽的花儿总还是会开败。”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“……”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i>“但也许，我可以把它们摘下来风干，保存住最好看的样子，甚至可以编成花环送给重要的朋友。比如说……老师。”</i><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i><b>“亲爱的睡魔，时间还没到呢！<br />我肯定还有时间做这件事吧～♪”</b></i><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>少女小心地剪下开得最盛的那几枝，包含那朵异色矢车菊。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"风干花朵\">风干花朵</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"编织花环\">编织花环</div></div>\n<div>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"风干花朵\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_05.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 05.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_05.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_05.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_05.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"760\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"编织花环\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_06.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 06.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_06.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_06.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_06.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"760\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<p>剩下的矢车菊还在继续生长，珍惜着这个难得的晴夜。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span><i><b>“然后我也要去休息了。<br />祝你们晚安～♪”</b></i><br /></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "矢车菊说起的那一年-04"}}